    evidence: "Examiner-informed practice", reference: "6032/03 · November 2022 · Q5(e)(i), PDF p. 8", source: paper3, provenance: reportProvenance,
    prompt: "Describe how an analogue signal is converted into digital data. Distinguish the effects of increasing sampling rate from increasing bit depth, and explain why filtering is required before sampling.",
